  "description": "The ExcelProvider loads an Excel worksheet and provides column definitions and row collections. All collections are IEnumerable so you can query them with LINQ. The ExcelProvider supports XLSX (Excel 2007-2019, v12-v16), XLS (Excel 97-2003, v8-v11) but it requires the installation of the Microsoft Access Database Engine 2016 Redistributable.",
